    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2>It is a log light side scroll action that controls the tempo freely.<br><br>Manipulate a magic wand that has lost its memory and proceed through a randomly connected map with numerous enemies and vicious traps.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comfortable and unique action</h2>Pathetic actions such as &quot;shot&quot;, &quot;dash&quot;, and &quot;jump&quot; include actions such as &quot;stagnation of time&quot;, &quot;reversal of time&quot;, and &quot;explosion magic&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460210/extras/e71a8cb9a6e2a33b676325cff4c0b2c4.poster.avif?t=1714482321\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460210/extras/e71a8cb9a6e2a33b676325cff4c0b2c4.webm?t=1714482321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460210/extras/e71a8cb9a6e2a33b676325cff4c0b2c4.mp4?t=1714482321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >time manipulation</h2>Clearing the game is not easy, but slowing it down gives you the freedom to attack and avoid.<br><br>If there is any inconvenience, we can rewind the time.<br>Let's pretend we didn't suffer any damage!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2>It is a log light side scroll action that controls the tempo freely.<br><br>Manipulate a magic wand that has lost its memory and proceed through a randomly connected map with numerous enemies and vicious traps.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comfortable and unique action</h2>Pathetic actions such as &quot;shot&quot;, &quot;dash&quot;, and &quot;jump&quot; include actions such as &quot;stagnation of time&quot;, &quot;reversal of time&quot;, and &quot;explosion magic&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460210/extras/e71a8cb9a6e2a33b676325cff4c0b2c4.poster.avif?t=1714482321\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460210/extras/e71a8cb9a6e2a33b676325cff4c0b2c4.webm?t=1714482321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460210/extras/e71a8cb9a6e2a33b676325cff4c0b2c4.mp4?t=1714482321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >time manipulation</h2>Clearing the game is not easy, but slowing it down gives you the freedom to attack and avoid.<br><br>If there is any inconvenience, we can rewind the time.<br>Let's pretend we didn't suffer any damage!",
    "short_description": "A roguelite action game drawn in black and white pixel art. Operate a magic wand that uses actions such as &quot;time stagnation&quot;, &quot;time leap&quot;, and &quot;explosion magic&quot;, Break through randomly connected dungeons",
